    seoDescription: "Microsoft plans to disable basic authentication for SMTP AUTH in Exchange Online in late December 2026. Here is what can stop sending in a brokerage and how to fix it",
    description: "Microsoft plans to disable basic authentication for SMTP AUTH in Exchange Online in late December 2026. Here is what can stop sending in a brokerage and how to fix it",
