    seoTitle: "Gmail 550 Bulk Sender Error for Agents",
    seoDescription: "Gmail's 550 bulk sender error means your listing email failed authentication. Here's what it means for agents and how to fix deliverability fast.",
    description: "Gmail's 550 bulk sender error means your listing email failed authentication. Here's what it means for agents and how to fix deliverability fast.",
    date: "2026-09-14",
