    title: "Why Your Real Estate Emails Go to Spam & How to Fix It",
    seoTitle: "Why Real Estate Emails Go to Spam",
    seoDescription: "Real estate emails go to spam from missing authentication, consumer addresses, and dead lists. Here's why it happens and how to fix inbox placement.",
    description: "Real estate emails go to spam from missing authentication, consumer addresses, and dead lists. Here's why it happens and how to fix inbox placement.",
    date: "2026-07-27",
